["TEXT","e248",130,430,0,"Power-up order: isolate external loads -> confirm VSYS / 1.8 V / 3.3 V -> reset and debug -> SiP / external Flash.","small",0]
["TEXT","e249",130,406,0,"Then enable display and touch, IMU, LRA and PPG individually. Start PPG LED currents low and measure 5 V droop.","small",0]
["TEXT","e250",130,382,0,"J101 is a 1.8 V debug interface. J202 / J402 / J501 are defined solder-wire pad banks, not purchased plug connectors.","small",0]
["TEXT","e251",130,358,0,"Full system supply current includes charging and transient loads. The regulator current rating is not a rail budget.","small",0]
["TEXT","e252",130,334,0,"A BOM/model pass or schematic DRC pass does not validate startup, sleep current, optics or PCB manufacturing.","small",0]
["TEXT","e253",130,310,0,"Read the revision notes and bring-up checklist before ordering boards. No routed PCB or Gerber is included.","small",0]
